      "id": "claim_6019e88a7f8a482ca73b374f10348dfe",
      "statement": "GatekeeperVendor is the service-binding root entrypoint: describe() (with providesAuth and autoProvisionsAccount flags), connectAccount(callback, options) returning an OAuth pop-up URL that must carry a cryptographic nonce, getSupportedResources(), getTypeScriptTypes() (a .d.ts parsed for the agent's progressive discovery), and an optional createAccount() for auto-provisioning vendors; connectAccount's resourceUrlPatterns must treat [] as 'none' rather than falling back to 'all'.",
